# **[![advanced drumming classes](/media/2013/12/image3017-1.png)](/media/2013/12/image3017-1.png)What's on - Advanced Drumming Classes Sunshine Coast April 2014**

Rhythm Culture is starting Advanced Drumming Classes from April 23rd for those of you that have had experience in African drumming either through Rhythm Culture classes or elsewhere. These classes will build on technique, dexterity, coordination, advanced rhythms and solos. This course is highly recommended for those that love a challenge! Palmwoods Girl Guides Hut Start April 23rd 2014 Wednesdays 6.30- 7.30pm $99 x 5 week course
